@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam classBackgroundColor #EEF4FB
title Maintenance Operations - Persistencia complementaria
entity assets {
 * id: uuid <<PK>>
 * tenant_id: uuid
 * plant_id: uuid <<FK>>
}
entity plants {
 * id: uuid <<PK>>
 * tenant_id: uuid
 * name: varchar(120)
 * default_responsible_user_id: uuid
}
entity alerts {
 * id: uuid <<PK>>
 * tenant_id: uuid
 * asset_id: uuid <<FK>>
}
entity notification_preferences {
 * id: uuid <<PK>>
 * tenant_id: uuid
 * plant_id: uuid <<FK>>
 * asset_type: varchar(80)
 * recipient_user_id: uuid
 * channel: varchar(10)
}
entity notification_deliveries {
 * id: uuid <<PK>>
 * tenant_id: uuid
 * alert_id: uuid <<FK>>
 * recipient_user_id: uuid
 * channel: varchar(10)
 * status: varchar(20)
 * attempted_at: timestamptz
}
entity downtime_intervals {
 * id: uuid <<PK>>
 * tenant_id: uuid
 * asset_id: uuid <<FK>>
 * started_at: timestamptz
 ended_at: timestamptz
}
entity production_windows {
 * id: uuid <<PK>>
 * tenant_id: uuid
 * asset_id: uuid <<FK>>
 * starts_at: timestamptz
 * ends_at: timestamptz
 * planned_seconds: numeric
 operating_seconds: numeric
 total_units: integer
 good_units: integer
 ideal_cycle_seconds: numeric
}
plants ||--o{ assets : agrupa
plants ||--o{ notification_preferences : configura
assets ||--o{ alerts : recibe
alerts ||--o{ notification_deliveries : notifica
assets ||--o{ downtime_intervals : registra
assets ||--o{ production_windows : mide
legend bottom
* NOT NULL. Todas las FK locales incluyen tenant_id.
UNIQUE(tenant_id,id) en plants, assets y alerts.
CHECK channel IN (PUSH, EMAIL).
CHECK ended_at IS NULL OR ended_at > started_at.
CHECK ends_at > starts_at; planned_seconds > 0.
Si presentes: 0 <= operating_seconds <= planned_seconds;
0 <= good_units <= total_units; ideal_cycle_seconds > 0.
UNIQUE(tenant_id,asset_id,starts_at,ends_at) en production_windows.
Las ventanas de producción no se solapan para el mismo activo.
Los UUID de usuario son referencias externas al contexto IAM.
endlegend
@enduml
